stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Available : t0
    Available --> Reserved : reserve() / t1
    Reserved --> Available : timeout after 10 minutes / t2
    Reserved --> Available : cancel() / t2
    Reserved --> InUse : unlock() / t3
    Available --> InUse : unlock() / t4
    InUse --> Available : returnToStation() / t5
    InUse --> Maintenance : reportFault() / t6
    Available --> Maintenance : batteryLow() [batteryLevel <= 20] / t7
    Maintenance --> Available : repaired() / t8
